k.push(new A.aj(B.em,A.F("\ud83d\udccc 1. General Service & Order Terms",n,n,n,n,n,B.eT,n,n,n),n))
k.push(o.bC("1. About the Service","FixonIndia Dry Cleaners provides dry cleaning, laundry, ironing, stain-treatment, garment-care, pickup and delivery services. Services may vary according to garment type, fabric, care label and processing requirements."))
k.push(o.bC("2. Acceptance of Terms","Placing an order, handing over garments, using pickup/drop, making payment or accepting delivery means the customer has had a reasonable opportunity to review these terms."))
k.push(o.bC("3. Order Record","An order may be recorded through a receipt, invoice, digital order, WhatsApp, phone communication or other business record. Recorded quantity, item description and applicable charges may be used for verification."))
k.push(o.bC("4. Pickup Policy","Garments should be ready for collection. Customers should disclose special instructions, known stains, delicate material, previous damage or other relevant information before processing."))
k.push(o.bC("5. Pickup & Delivery Timing","Pickup and delivery times are estimates unless a specific commitment is expressly confirmed. Customer unavailability, incorrect address, rescheduling or logistical issues may cause delay."))
k.push(o.bC("6. Garment Count & Identification","Garments may be tagged or otherwise identified. Customers should check quantity and description at hand-over and report discrepancies promptly."))
k.push(new A.aj(B.em,A.F("\ud83d\udc54 2. Garment Care & Fabric Risk Policy",n,n,n,n,n,B.eT,n,n,n),n))
k.push(o.bC("7. Pre-existing Damage","FixonIndia is not responsible for damage that existed before processing, including weakened fabric, tears, loose stitching, fading, worn coatings, damaged buttons, zippers or embellishments, subject to applicable law."))
k.push(o.bC("8. Care Labels","Processing follows available care-label information and professional judgment. Missing, inaccurate or unsuitable care instructions may increase processing risk."))
k.push(o.bC("9. Delicate & High-Risk Garments","Silk, wool, velvet, designer garments, embroidery, sequins, stones, glued accessories, leather/suede, vintage items and similar articles may carry inherent processing risks. FixonIndia may decline items where safe processing cannot reasonably be assured."))
k.push(o.bC("10. Stain Removal","Stain removal is not guaranteed. Some stains are permanent or may require treatment that affects colour, texture or fabric."))
k.push(o.bC("11. Colour Bleeding & Fabric Reaction","Certain dyes, prints, coatings and mixed materials may react unpredictably. Inherent material reactions will be considered when assessing responsibility, subject to applicable law."))
k.push(o.bC("12. Shrinkage & Fabric Changes","Shrinkage, texture changes, stretching or colour variation may arise from fabric characteristics, prior wear, manufacturing defects or care instructions. Claims will be assessed based on the actual circumstances."))
k.push(new A.aj(B.em,A.F("\u2696\ufe0f 3. Loss & Damage Compensation (Max 5x)",n,n,n,n,n,B.eT,n,n,n),n))
k.push(o.bC("13. Damage Caused During Processing","Where an eligible claim establishes FixonIndia's responsibility for damage during processing, the claim will be handled under the compensation policy below, subject to applicable law."))
k.push(o.bC("14. Loss of Garments","Where an item is confirmed lost while under FixonIndia's responsibility and the claim is eligible, compensation will be considered under the loss/damage policy."))
k.push(o.bC("15. Loss & Damage Compensation \u2013 Maximum 5\xd7","Where FixonIndia accepts responsibility for an eligible loss or damage claim, the standard maximum compensation for an individual garment shall be UP TO 5 TIMES the applicable dry-cleaning/processing charge for that item.\nExample: \u20b9200 processing charge \u2192 maximum \u20b91,000. \u20b9500 processing charge \u2192 maximum \u20b92,500.\nThis is a contractual service compensation limit, not a valuation of the garment itself."))
k.push(o.bC("16. Service Charge vs Garment Value","The processing charge is not the purchase price or market value of the garment. Compensation under this policy is calculated by reference to the applicable processing charge, subject to applicable law."))
k.push(o.bC("17. High-Value Garments","Customers should disclose unusually high-value, designer, luxury, antique or collectible garments before processing. FixonIndia may request information or decline processing where appropriate."))
k.push(o.bC("18. Sentimental Value","Sentimental or personal value does not automatically increase monetary compensation under this service policy."))
k.push(o.bC("19. Claim Procedure","Customers should report loss or damage as soon as reasonably possible. FixonIndia may request the receipt, garment details, photographs, proof of payment and other information needed to investigate."))
k.push(o.bC("20. Claim Investigation","FixonIndia may inspect garments, compare order records and review processing information before deciding whether a claim is attributable to FixonIndia."))
k.push(new A.aj(B.em,A.F("\ud83d\udce6 4. Delivery, Pockets & Accessories",n,n,n,n,n,B.eT,n,n,n),n))
k.push(o.bC("21. Damage Reported After Delivery","Customers should inspect garments promptly. If damage is noticed, customers should avoid further washing, ironing, alteration or third-party treatment before contacting FixonIndia."))
k.push(o.bC("22. Items Left in Pockets","Customers should check pockets before hand-over. FixonIndia is not responsible for money, documents, electronics, jewellery, keys or other valuables left inside pockets, except where liability is imposed by applicable law."))
k.push(o.bC("23. Buttons, Zippers & Accessories","Loose, worn, glued, heat-sensitive or aged accessories may detach or become damaged during processing. These inherent risks will be considered when evaluating a claim."))
k.push(o.bC("24. Leather & Suede","Leather, suede and similar specialty materials may require specialist treatment. FixonIndia may refuse processing where ordinary processes are unsuitable."))
k.push(o.bC("25. Packing & Delivery","Garments may be folded, hung, covered or packed according to the service selected. Customers should verify garment count and apparent condition at delivery where reasonably possible."))
k.push(o.bC("26. Authorized Person","Delivery to a person authorized by the customer at the stated address may be treated as delivery to the customer."))
k.push(o.bC("27. Wrong Address / Failed Delivery","Incorrect address, inaccessible premises or customer unavailability may require rescheduling and may cause delay. Any applicable additional charge will be communicated where reasonably possible."))
k.push(o.bC("28. Delayed Delivery","Processing may be delayed by garment complexity, reprocessing, equipment issues, weather, holidays, logistics, customer instructions or circumstances beyond reasonable control."))
k.push(o.bC("29. Unclaimed Garments","Customers should collect or accept delivery within a reasonable period. Long-unclaimed garments may be subject to storage, reminder or disposal procedures to the extent permitted by applicable law."))
k.push(new A.aj(B.em,A.F("\ud83d\udcb3 5. Pricing, Payments & Consumer Rights",n,n,n,n,n,B.eT,n,n,n),n))
k.push(o.bC("30. Pricing & Payment","Prices are communicated through the applicable rate card, quotation, invoice, order or customer communication. Payment may be required at booking, pickup, delivery or completion."))
k.push(o.bC("31. Taxes","Applicable taxes or statutory charges, if any, may be added to the service price and reflected or communicated in the transaction record."))
k.push(o.bC("32. Refunds","Refunds, credits or reprocessing, where applicable, are considered according to the service ordered, payment record, cancellation circumstances and applicable law."))
k.push(o.bC("33. Complaints","Customers may contact FixonIndia regarding service concerns. Complaints will be reviewed using available records and applicable law."))
k.push(o.bC("34. Consumer Rights","Nothing in these terms is intended to remove or restrict a statutory consumer right or remedy that cannot lawfully be excluded. The Consumer Protection Act, 2019 provides the principal statutory consumer-protection framework in India."))
k.push(o.bC("35. Fair & Transparent Service","FixonIndia aims to provide clear service descriptions, pricing information, order records and complaint handling."))
k.push(new A.aj(B.em,A.F("\ud83d\udd12 6. Privacy Policy & Personal Data",n,n,n,n,n,B.eT,n,n,n),n))
k.push(o.bC("36. Privacy \u2013 Information Collected","FixonIndia may collect name, phone number, address, order details, garment details, payment information and customer communications needed for service delivery and support."))
k.push(o.bC("37. Purpose of Personal Data","Information may be used for pickup/drop, order processing, billing, customer support, service updates, complaints, fraud prevention, record keeping and legitimate business purposes."))
k.push(o.bC("38. Consent & Communications","By providing contact details and placing an order, the customer permits service-related communication. Marketing communications, where used, should be handled according to applicable law and available customer choices."))
k.push(o.bC("39. Phone Number Use","Phone numbers may be used to coordinate pickup/drop, confirm orders, discuss garment issues and provide support."))
k.push(o.bC("40. Data Sharing","Information may be shared with delivery personnel, payment processors, technology providers or authorities where reasonably necessary for service delivery, legal compliance, fraud prevention or protection of rights, subject to applicable law."))
k.push(o.bC("41. Data Security","FixonIndia will take reasonable organizational and technical measures appropriate to the information handled. No electronic system can be guaranteed completely secure."))
k.push(o.bC("42. Photos & Garment Records","Photos may be taken when reasonably required for identification, condition records, stain documentation, claim investigation or service operations."))
k.push(o.bC("43. Data Retention","Records may be retained as reasonably necessary for order administration, accounting, dispute resolution, legal compliance, fraud prevention and business records."))
k.push(o.bC("44. Digital Personal Data Law","Where applicable, personal-data handling will follow Indian data-protection law. The Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 has a phased commencement framework; applicable obligations depend on the provisions in force at the relevant time."))
k.push(o.bC("45. Third-Party Technology","FixonIndia may use third-party messaging, payment, hosting, software or logistics providers, which may have their own terms and privacy practices."))
k.push(new A.aj(B.em,A.F("\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f 7. Security, Jurisdiction & Contact",n,n,n,n,n,B.eT,n,n,n),n))
k.push(o.bC("46. Cyber Fraud Warning","Customers should never share OTPs, UPI PINs, passwords, card PINs or other confidential authentication information with anyone claiming to represent FixonIndia."))
k.push(o.bC("47. Fraudulent Orders / Misuse","FixonIndia may restrict or cancel orders involving suspected fraud, false information, abusive conduct or payment manipulation, subject to applicable law."))
k.push(o.bC("48. Force Majeure","FixonIndia is not responsible for delays caused by events reasonably beyond its control, including natural disasters, major infrastructure failures, strikes, government restrictions, severe weather or transport disruption."))
k.push(o.bC("49. Policy Changes","FixonIndia may update these terms. The version applicable to an order will generally be the version communicated or made available when the order is placed, subject to applicable law."))
k.push(o.bC("50. Governing Law & Jurisdiction","These terms are intended to be governed by the laws of India. Disputes remain subject to applicable Indian law and legally available consumer remedies."))
k.push(o.bC("51. Customer Acceptance","Using FixonIndia Dry Cleaners services confirms acceptance of these service conditions, subject to applicable statutory rights."))
k.push(o.bC("52. Official Contact Information","FixonIndia Dry Cleaners\nPhone/WhatsApp: +91 9540950802\nEmail: support@fixonindia.com\nWebsite: www.fixonindia.com\nService Area: Gurugram, Haryana, India."))
